{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Latch payload failures before exposing them to handler code.** On replay, this runs inside `DurableFuture.get()`. A handler can catch a load, digest, or ownership `PayloadOffloadException` and return a fallback, allowing `SUCCEEDED` despite unreadable checkpoint state. Call `ExecutionManager.failInvocation` before rethrowing operation codec failures, and test a handler that catches a failing replay load.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pp37J","finding_digest":"2ec131212397cd9577c0ea4e5088cd067cea35b6785f31dd1c201c9a57093e87","finding_id":"arf_v1_f3atcijds7gzk56a5jhfbcgnaz","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeresult::unlatched-payload-failure","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeresult::unlatched-payload-failure","line":137,"observation_digest":"7de881406d6782c0eb96f995f15073f48584d64ee71be94b54e80c1e8b6f95d1","observation_id":"aro_v1_pxuicqdnm6bmb24w7gk7cudt6s","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:58:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vnej7biqklapuyocr3sx64w35k","reviewed_base_sha":"4c6822cc220948aebb437a95ebe6acc0cb1c2175","reviewed_head_sha":"a52a63745d2f0ef2031adef2aeb872568f0fafbf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":130,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_dwjonf4qktcqipdssempeyyz24","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:58:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
